{
  "_what_this_is": [
    "The one-time genesis manifest for the pull request that replaces the factory trust root.",
    "It describes what this tree IS -- its base, its trust-root inventory, and the governance",
    "files it pins -- and deliberately never says what would be GOOD ENOUGH. Minimums, required",
    "stages, mutation families, trust-root scope and pinned-policy scope all come from the",
    "external genesis policy, which is not read from this repository. A candidate that authors",
    "its own standard can satisfy an artificially weak one honestly, so the candidate is not",
    "permitted to author it.",
    "",
    "This file governs nothing after genesis. It is excluded from the hashed prefixes on",
    "principle: if it fell inside one it would have to contain its own hash, and no fixed point",
    "exists. It is also not part of the persistent trust root that ordinary pull requests are",
    "judged against."
  ],
